        "text": "Wistia lists 75 MCP tools, including archive-media, bulk-copy-media, bulk-delete-subfolders, bulk-tag-media, copy-folder, copy-media, create-captions, create-channel, create-channel-episode, create-folder, create-folder-sharing, and create-localization."
      }
